    # "While Erigone was a decidedly unsafe place due to the fighting between the castes, the immediate surroundings of the Citadel were secure and relatively quiet."
    "Même si Érigone était un endroit décidément dangereux à cause des combats entre les castes, les environs immédiats de la Citadelle étaient sûrs et relativement calmes."

# game/episode025.rpy:2035
translate french ep025_erigone_grove_49b2f4d8:

    # "There was a small lake near the Citadel, which was often used by the Acarhyn to bathe."
