    # "There was a small lake near the Shipyards, which was often used by the Acarhyn to bathe."
    "Il y avait un petit lac près des Chantiers navals, où les Acarhyn allaient souvent se baigner."

# game/episode025.rpy:2040
translate french ep025_erigone_grove_486a090d:

    # "Eva had asked to meet me there."
    "Eva m’avait demandé de la retrouver là-bas."

# game/episode025.rpy:2045
