    # "The grove was surrounded by armed guards who were obviously there to guard their Queen."
    "Le bosquet était entouré de gardes armés qui étaient manifestement là pour protéger leur reine."

# game/episode025.rpy:2046
translate french ep025_erigone_grove_e616e86b:

    # "I was allowed access without issue."
    "On m’a laissé entrer sans problème."

# game/episode025.rpy:2047
translate french ep025_erigone_grove_fa1b4780:

    # "Walking through the thick jungle, I could hear the lapping water already."
