# game/episode025.rpy:2049
translate french ep025_erigone_grove_b73b64a6:

    # "As soon as the foliage became less overgrown, a lake enclosed by rocky cliffs revealed itself."
    "Dès que la végétation s’est éclaircie, un lac entouré de falaises rocheuses s’est révélé à moi."

# game/episode025.rpy:2050
translate french ep025_erigone_grove_02509929:

    # "A large tree branch crossed the lake."
    "Une grosse branche d’arbre enjambait le lac."

# game/episode025.rpy:2053
translate french ep025_erigone_grove_d2610381:

    # "I saw Eva floating by underneath me, her pregnant form proudly on display and her eyes closed, seemingly at peace."
    "J’ai vu Eva flotter sous moi, sa silhouette de femme enceinte fièrement mise en valeur, les yeux fermés, l’air serein."

# game/episode025.rpy:2056
