    # "We were both suddenly very aware that we were surrounded by Acarhyn who could walk in on us, or hear us at the very least."
    "On a soudain pris conscience qu’on était entourées d’Acarhyn qui pouvaient nous surprendre, ou au moins nous entendre."

# game/episode025.rpy:2157
